# Story: As a truck driver, I want to move my booking to another slot, so that I can keep my container booked when I am running late. Rescheduling moves the booking to the new slot if it has room, frees the place in the old slot, and keeps the same booking reference. Moving to a full slot is refused with SLOT_FULL; moving to the same slot is refused with SAME_SLOT.

@draft
Feature: Reschedule Booking

  Scenario Outline: Move a booking to another available slot
    Given I am a driver
    And the slot has 1 place left
    When I book that slot for a valid container
    Then the booking is confirmed with a reference

    Examples:
      | new_slot          |
      | a gate slot tomorrow at 09:30 with room for 1 truck |
      | a gate slot starting in 30 minutes with room for 1 truck |

  Scenario Outline: Move to a full slot
    Given I am a driver
    And the slot has 0 place(s) left
    When I book that slot for a valid container
    Then the booking is refused because "SLOT_FULL"

    Examples:
      | new_slot          |
      | a gate slot tomorrow at 18:00 with room for 0 trucks |

  Scenario Outline: Move to the same slot
    Given I am a driver
    And the slot has 1 place left
    When I book that slot for a valid container
    Then the change is refused because "SAME_SLOT"

    Examples:
      | new_slot          |
      | a gate slot tomorrow at 09:30 with room for 1 truck |

  Scenario Outline: Move to an already booked slot
    Given I am a driver
